  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2025 Grant to CFSC for Conflict Prevention Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The &quot;promoting peaceful co-existence among faith groups through dialogue and conflict management&quot; project aims to sustain religious tolerance leading to peaceful coexistence among faith groups in Mangochi district. The project places a strong emphasis on women&apos;s inclusion, recognising their critical role in peace building &#xa0;and conflict management. The projects works engages women village bureaus to strengthen peace and security.</narrative>
  </description>
